eriences: VR and 360\u00ba documentaries, linear videos and photo galleries covering pressing global issues from the Rohingya refugee crisis to environmental devastation in Nigeria. \n\n\nImmerse yourself deeper in the story. Be transported to regions that are underreported. Hear from voices on the ground as they share their own perspectives directly in VR. \n\nLearn more about the studio at ajcontrast.com. Send questions or feedback to contrast.VR@aljazeera.net  ", "short_description": "AJ Contrast \u2013 Al Jazeera\u2019s immersive storytelling and media innovation studio \u2013 pushes the boundaries of storytelling while taking viewers directly to the front lines of the biggest news events around the world."}]}, "developer_name": "Shaking Earth Digital, LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://apps.aljazeera.net/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://apps.aljazeera.net/privacy/", "publisher_name": "Al Jazeera Media Network", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.ajcontrast.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["DOCUMENTARY_HISTORY", "EDUCATIONAL", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "6929482137121883"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12410440_2022740924644497_1187491546048495616_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cSCN0zXCv9UQ7kNvwFf9eFT&_nc_oc=AdqT_TRW12Z1Hz2MCrs8xH1V6ZKH1vGfSW_z7NrGR-3AtkZdSoNU-1